"lines": [
{
"i": 0,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 6.09,
"text": "This is Tony. Tony is a fitness coach. He's good. His clients lose the weight and keep it off."
},
{
"i": 1,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 6.33,
"t1": 9.23,
"text": "Twelve weeks. Real results."
},
{
"i": 2,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 9.58,
"t1": 32.4,
"text": "Tony makes good money. As long as he never stops. Here's how Tony gets clients. Door number one: ads. Every client costs him about two hundred dollars in ads. And every year, that number goes up. Stop paying, and the clients stop. Door number two: content. A workout at five a m. A meal prep at noon. A live at night. Every single day."
},
{
"i": 3,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 32.63,
"t1": 34.82,
"text": "If I miss a day, I feel it."
},
{
"i": 4,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 35.1,
"t1": 62.28,
"text": "He does. Take one week off and his leads disappear. And his leads are everywhere. Some in his d m s. Some on his email list. Some on whatsapp, some on a booking page, some on his course platform. Every jump between apps loses people. Then the algorithm changes, or his ad account gets flagged. And the traffic he worked so hard for is gone. Because it was never his. So Tony does the math. Want twice the income?"
},
{
"i": 5,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 62.54,
"t1": 63.63,
"text": "Twice the clients?"
},
{
"i": 6,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 63.82,
"t1": 70.37,
"text": "Twice the ad spend. Or twice the posting. Tony isn't running a business. He's running on a treadmill."
},
{
"i": 7,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 70.77,
"t1": 73.03,
"text": "So how do the big coaches grow?"
},
{
"i": 8,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 73.4,
"t1": 127.93,
"text": "Look at Tony's clients. Every single one came from Tony. Not one came from another client. Think about the busiest gym in town. It doesn't buy every member with an ad. An ad brings someone in once. A member comes back and brings a friend. That's what viral really means. Not views. People sharing. And for that, people need one place to belong. So Tony gets a free community. Every ad, every post, every referral, every affiliate, every partnership sends people to one place. Joining is free. No checkout. Just a link. And a free link is easy to share. Inside, a simple onboarding welcomes each person and shows them what's right for them. Within five minutes, they buy something. By day one, they notice their results. By week one, they're ready for the full program. And when Tony launches his thirty day challenge they're already inside. No ads."
},
{
"i": 9,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 128.2,
"t1": 129.86,
"text": "And they post their progress."
},
{
"i": 10,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 130.17,
"t1": 141.95,
"text": "And bring their gym buddy. Who brings theirs. Followers become members. Members become buyers. Buyers bring new members. That's a viral loop. One month later, Tony took a week off."
},
{
"i": 11,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 142.32,
"t1": 143.59,
"text": "Did my leads disappear?"
},
{
"i": 12,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 144.08,
"t1": 168.23,
"text": "The community kept growing while he was gone. That's what Buzztorm builds. You bring your expertise and record your content once. We build the community, the onboarding, the offers and the payments. Your members, your content, your sales stay yours. And if it's not the right fit, we'll tell you before you pay. Book a free thirty minute call at buzztorm dot com. You'll leave with a plan, even if you don't hire us."
},
{
"i": 13,
"sp": "T",
"t0": 168.53,
"t1": 170.67,
"text": "Can I finally take off the ring light?"
},
{
"i": 14,
"sp": "D",
"t0": 170.9,
"t1": 171.66,
"text": "Please."
}
]
}